{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#card-zh","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ansys-agent-bridge 是把 Ansys SpaceClaim 几何操作接入 DSH 的 MCP 工具包，通过一个 MCP 客户端层注册服务器。它能检测本机 Ansys 环境、启动或连接 SpaceClaim 会话、读取和检查 CAD 几何、创建管体与拉伸实体，并执行布尔操作、变换及多种格式导出；修改操作会核验几何是否实际变化。适合需要用 DSH agent 检查或处理 SpaceClaim 模型的工程工作流。需要 Windows、Ansys SpaceClaim 和 uv；默认启动配置从 GitHub 获取服务代码。","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:136-179","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:341-375","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:636-695","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:770-788","cordis.patch.yml:100-112"]}
{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#card-en","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ansys-agent-bridge connects DSH to SpaceClaim through MCP. It inspects CAD geometry, creates pipes and extrusions, applies boolean operations, and exports models. Changes are verified from geometry measurements. For agent-assisted CAD work. Requires Windows, Ansys SpaceClaim, and uv.","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:136-179","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:341-375","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:636-695","spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:770-788","cordis.patch.yml:100-112"]}
