{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#feature-1","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ansys-agent-bridge 的功能「几何环境诊断」：调用 ansys_bridge_doctor，返回检测到的 Ansys 版本、SpaceClaim 和 Fluent 路径、Python 及依赖版本，供启动前检查本机环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:136-176"]}
{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#feature-2","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ansys-agent-bridge 的功能「几何检查」：调用 scdm_inspect_geometry 检查当前设计的重复面、短边、小面等几何状况，并返回检测结果供定位问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:483-543"]}
{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#feature-3","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ansys-agent-bridge 的功能「创建管体」：调用 scdm_create_pipe，输入外径、长度及可选内径和轴向，在当前设计中创建空心管或实心杆，并校验截面与挤出体积。","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:636-694"]}
{"unit_id":"1622352030__ansys-agent-bridge#feature-4","repo":"1622352030/ansys-agent-bridge","commit":"ed39bc46917148d16c673164bd478f14c9f7ca4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ansys-agent-bridge 的功能「导出 CAD 文件」：调用 scdm_export 并指定格式及输出文件名，将当前设计导出为 SCdocx、STEP、IGES、Parasolid 或 PMDB 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["spaceclaim/python/src/ansys_bridge_mcp/server.py:770-807"]}
